9e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 26, "prompt": "You hear the manager of a care home for the elderly talking to the nursing staff.\nHe says that errors in dispensing medication to patients usually result from\nA interruptions while calculating dosages.\nB a failure to check for patients’ allergies.\nC administering drugs late in the day.", "sourcePage": 43, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "A", "page": 50, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 27, "prompt": "You hear part of a morning briefing on a hospital ward.\nWhat is the plan for the patient today?\nA Her emotional state will be carefully observed.\nB She will be transferred to a more specialised unit.\nC A social worker will come to see what help she needs.", "sourcePage": 43, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "A", "page": 50, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 28, "prompt": "You hear part of an ante-natal consultation at a GP practice.\nWhat does the patient want to know about?\nA the advisability of a home birth\nB ways of avoiding post-natal depression\nC what painkillers might be available during labour", "sourcePage": 44, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "C", "page": 50, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 29, "prompt": "You hear a trainee doctor telling his supervisor about a problem he had carrying out a procedure.\nThe trainee feels the cause of the problem was\nA treatment administered previously.\nB the patient’s negative reaction.\nC inappropriate equipment.", "sourcePage": 44, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "A", "page": 50, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 30, "prompt": "You hear a doctor talking to a teenage boy who has a painful wrist.\nThe doctor wants to establish whether\nA a fracture may be misaligned.\nB the swelling may be due to a sprain.\nC there may be more than one bone affected.", "sourcePage": 44, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "A", "page": 50, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}], "skills": ["listening"], "recordings": ["a3f03042f4f360d49224bd88e5b6258ea78f6aa948ff797e37f9e3ca2c46311d"], "answerSources": [], "matchEvidence": "Exact original recording SHA-256 in the verified Jahshan collection"}]}
